&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides a &lt;strong&gt;detail view&lt;/strong&gt; for a specific apertura (&lt;code&gt;/aperturas/risk/123&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses the same &lt;strong&gt;auth‑guarded lib functions&lt;/strong&gt; to fetch both the master record and its child items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


2. Server Actions for Mutations
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;


&lt;code&gt;app/(app)/aperturas/actions.ts&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h4&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
